# Public page theme

Read [docs/SPEC-public-page.md](docs/SPEC-public-page.md) before changing markup.

1. Reuse `public-page/tokens.css` and `public-page/components.css`. Do not invent a second palette.
2. Scanner page only: no edit, share, field-picker drawer, or Apple/Google save (private ingress).
3. Bind **slots** (`photo`, `title`, `subtitle`, `highlights`, `badges`, `tags`, `facts`, `documents`, `links`). Never `Animal`, `tagNumber`, or `ownerEmail`.
4. `GENERIC` v1: hero + facts + links. Do not fake Documents/Visas tabs or Cooper copy.
5. Flip + tabs need keyboard, `prefers-reduced-motion`, and public-flagged fields only.
6. Treat Figma Make as the visual source. FigJam is exploratory context only; do not implement its owner or Wallet ID flows.
7. Document/visa URLs are caller-supplied public HTTPS links hosted by external services. Never proxy them or append tokens; use `noopener noreferrer` and suppress unsafe schemes.
